{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2057"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/ball-sports","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__ball-sports.g2.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",910],["+","The ranking Langer once headed has not always guaranteed a place on the biggest stages. When golf returned to the Olympic Games in Rio de Janeiro in 2016 after 112 years, the reigning world number one, the Australian Jason Day, withdrew in June 2016, citing fears of the Zika virus; several other leading men stayed away too.\n\n"],["=",127]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",862],["+","Die Rangliste, die Langer einst anführte, garantierte nicht immer einen Platz auf den größten Bühnen. Als Golf 2016 in Rio de Janeiro nach 112 Jahren zu den Olympischen Spielen zurückkehrte, sagte der amtierende Weltranglistenerste, der Australier Jason Day, im Juni 2016 seine Teilnahme aus Angst vor dem Zika-Virus ab; auch mehrere andere Spitzenspieler blieben fern.\n\n"],["=",123]]}]},
